      "blocks": {
        "text_nNUPjN": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ol><li>You automatically become a part of the <strong>Kalpana Creations Loyalty Program</strong> after your first purchase with us.<br/></li><li>The <strong>mobile number provided at the time of billing</strong> will be used to register your account and credit your loyalty points.<br/></li><li>Loyalty points are earned from your <strong>first purchase onwards</strong> when you provide your mobile number. For store purchases, points will be credited after <strong>3 days</strong> from the date of purchase. For online purchases, points will be credited once the <strong>return window closes</strong>.<br/></li><li>Loyalty points can be <strong>redeemed from your second purchase onwards</strong>, once the earned points have been credited to your account.<br/></li><li>For online purchases, loyalty points can be redeemed only through the <strong>Kalpana Creations online platform/app</strong>, wherever applicable.<br/></li><li>Loyalty points are earned as a <strong>percentage of the bill value</strong>, based on the applicable loyalty tier or eligible slab.<br/></li><li>Only purchases made within the <strong>last 1 year</strong> will be considered while determining the customer’s eligible loyalty tier.<br/></li><li>Purchases made both <strong>online and at Kalpana Creations stores</strong> will be considered together for calculating loyalty benefits.<br/></li><li>Loyalty points are applicable on both <strong>discounted and non-discounted products</strong>. However, loyalty points will not be applicable on <strong>product customization charges</strong>.<br/></li><li><strong>Redeeming loyalty points is completely optional</strong> and customers may choose whether or not to use their available points.<br/></li><li>Loyalty points are valid for <strong>6 months from the date they are credited</strong>. Any unused points will automatically expire after the validity period.<br/></li><li>Details regarding <strong>points earned, redeemed, and available balance</strong> will be communicated through the registered communication channels.<br/></li><li>Loyalty points <strong>cannot be exchanged for cash</strong> and can only be redeemed against eligible purchases.<br/></li><li><strong>Kalpana Creations management reserves the right to modify, suspend, withdraw, or discontinue the loyalty program or any of its benefits at any time without prior notice.</strong></li></ol>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
